      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COLLINDA RAMSAY (6) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish 5 lengths away in second (24.50) at this track in a T3 Grade 6 over 425m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Winning claims. IVORY RAMEN (3) finds it hard to win. Hit the board with a minor placing last time when third (24.67) at this track. Hard to beat again. MINH ARDIE (1) had been going along well winning a Bottom Up - Grade 7 three back then placing at Warragul before missing the frame latest when fourth (25.85) at Sale. Well placed here and should do much better. AUBREY MISS (2) is new here but should be in the mix.",
